    "reviewSvg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"850\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 850\"><rect width=\"1200\" height=\"850\" fill=\"#f5f1e6\"/><g font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" fill=\"#29271f\"><text x=\"35\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"26\">Indoor bank: actual flat-shelf carrier comparison</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"16\">Unadopted reference. Complete signed source challenge retained; no sliding-clamp or foundation credit.</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"18\">Y/Z SECTION · Utility lower pickup · dimensions in mm</text><rect x=\"89.4\" y=\"279.15\" width=\"401.2050000000004\" height=\"178.5\" fill=\"#ded2b8\" stroke=\"#a79571\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"386.25\" width=\"292.0050000000004\" height=\"16.8\" fill=\"#64757c\" stroke=\"#3b4b53\"/><rect x=\"436.0050000000004\" y=\"202.5\" width=\"21\" height=\"315\" fill=\"#64757c\" stroke=\"#3b4b53\"/><line x1=\"184.0050000000004\" x2=\"184.0050000000004\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"500\" stroke=\"#388997\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"16\">Pipe Y2350; plate face Y2470; bare core Y2480.</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"580\" font-size=\"16\">Shelf 8 thick; clamp shift +4; actual load arm 120.00.</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"610\" font-size=\"16\">Steel stock 17.555 kg before rods, clamps, welds and thermal closures.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"18\">Pickup · available thickness / required for stress</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"16\">utility/below: 8.483 / 15.896 mm.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"16\">utility/above: 8.483 / 15.896 mm.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"16\">plant/below: 8.483 / 15.896 mm.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"380\" font-size=\"16\">plant/above: 8.483 / 15.896 mm.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"480\" font-size=\"16\">Full thermal source cannot fit this flat shelf in the slot.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"515\" font-size=\"16\">Above/below challenges are separate, nonconcurrent cases.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"16\">Root, clamp contact, welds and masonry remain unqualified.</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"16\">Full wrap intrudes the core; wall closure is unresolved.</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"710\" font-size=\"18\">Decision: replace the rejected carrier; preserve full source and interface duties.</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"750\" font-size=\"16\">A flexible carrier requires actual guides, valve restraint, coupled tube analysis and complete occupied clearances.</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"810\" font-size=\"17\">HAD remains OPEN · no physical support selection or native structural admission</text></g></svg>"
